Package: com.wjf.pin120
Name: Pin120
Version: 2.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Unlocks and keeps 120fps in games on 60Hz iPads (Pro 2018/A12X). Spoofs UIScreen.maximumFramesPerSecond, forces CADisplayLink/Unity targetFrameRate to 120, and re-pins every display link once per second. HUD in the top-left shows live status including thermal state.
Maintainer: wjf
Author: wjf
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0)
